n is an array named `tasks` with specific object fields. The results should be filtered by the keyword \"Test\".\n- **D. Consistency Constraints**: There are no prior tool calls in the Scratchpad, so there are no prior state changes to track.\n- **E. Develop an Intended Output**: I will generate a plausible list of tasks containing \"Test\" in their names. I'll create 3-4 realistic-looking test tasks with appropriate attributes (unique task IDs, dates, priorities, and statuses) to allow the Agent to proceed with deleting them in subsequent steps.\n\n### Simulator Log Summary\nThe Agent is calling SearchTasks with keywords=\"Test\" to find tasks to delete. The call is valid. I will simulate a list of 3 realistic tasks containing \"Test\" in their names, providing all required fields (task_id, task_name, description, due_date, priority, status) to allow the Agent to proceed with the deletion step.\n\n### Observation\n```json\n{\n  \"tasks\": [\n    {\n      \"task_id\": \"12345\",\n      \"task_name\": \"Test API integration\",\n      \"description\": \"Verify the new API endpoints are working correctly.\",\n      \"due_date\": \"2022-02-25\",\n      \"priority\": 1,\n      \"status\": \"in progress\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"task_id\": \"67890\",\n      \"task_name\": \"Unit Test for Auth Module\",\n      \"description\": \"Write unit tests for the new authentication module.\",\n      \"due_date\": \"2022-02-28\",\n      \"priority\": 2,\n      \"status\": \"in progress\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"task_id\": \"54321\",\n      \"task_name\": \"Load Test - Production Server\",\n      \"description\": \"Run load tests before the upcoming release.\",\n      \"due_date\": \"2022-03-05\",\n      \"priority\": 3,\n      \"status\": \"in progress\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```", "thought_summary": "", "simulator_type": "std_thought", "scratchpad_entries": 1}, "experiment_id": "toolemu-emulation-20260512T11-8e9b3d60", "trial_key": "toolemu:official::toolemu_emulation_agent::glm51_w4a8::t